Note, drawing rectangles, circles and text on a canvas.
Note, the whole picture is redrawn on every tick.

Open window with title Shapes.
Add canvas board with width 400 and height 300.

Let angle be 0.

Every 40 milliseconds, do the following.
Add 6 to angle.
Clear canvas.
Draw rectangle at 20 by 20 with width 360 and height 40 and color blue.
Draw text Moving circle at 200 by 40 with color black.
Draw circle at the value of angle by 160 with radius 25 and color yellow.
Draw circle at 380 minus angle by 240 with radius 15 and color pink.
If the value of angle is greater than 380, do the following.
Set angle to 0.
End if.
End every.
